  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.3-alpha\n    Removed outer documents since they did not truly represent entities in the domain model.\n    Added release notes.\n    Upddated Copyright at top of generated code.\n\n0.2.0-alpha\n    Values with unspecified multiplicity now are collections.\n    Changed package id to beneficialstrategies.iso20022.\n\n0.2.1-alpha\n    Mixed casing on package id.\n\n0.2.2-alpha\n    Removed Amounts from simpletypes.\n    Generated Amounts including currency type.\n\n0.2.3-alpha\n    Still currency types missing from amounts.\n\n0.2.4-alpha \n    Tweaks in structure changes for serialization.\n    Updated sample in readme.\n\n0.2.5-alpha\n    Added JsonDerivedType attributes on abstract choice values to enable JSON serialization.\n\n0.2.6-alpha\n    Removed StringLengthAttribute from collections, causing JSON serialization problems.\n\n0.3.0-alpha\n    Reorganized all message definitions under MessageDefinitions/ subdirectory.\n    Fixed broken build: corrected invalid TargetFrameworks TFMs, added missing global namespace usings.\n    Library now targets net8.0 only; leverages C# 12 required members and global type aliases.\n    Stripped ~1.9M lines of dead preprocessor directives for obsolete .NET versions.\n    Added GitHub Actions workflow for automated NuGet publishing on version tags.",
